    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>CN</mi><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>Ether</mi><mrow><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>MgBr</mi></mrow></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>HCl</mi><mrow><mi>Zn</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>Hg</mi></mrow></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>.&nbsp;The correct structure of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is",
